        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A heat pump dryer is not a faster dryer. It is a more efficient, gentler and far more flexible one, and for anyone who cannot vent a conventional machine it is the best answer to a real problem. Our top overall pick is the LG full-size model, with the Bosch 800 Series the one to beat for stacked closets and the GE Profile combo for single-appliance spaces.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you choose, check the voltage, plan the condensate, and keep the filters clean. Do those three things, accept the longer cycles, and a heat pump dryer will quietly save energy and look after your clothes for years.
          </p>
        </div>

